Build rep- and account-level productivity analytics that surface performance gaps and coaching needs
Establish the Commercial Operating Cadence:
Define and lead a weekly forecast call, monthly pipeline inspection, and quarterly business review cycle
Establish core commercial KPIs and scorecards trusted by Sales, Finance, and the Board
Extend consistent process and cadence discipline across U.S., European, and CRO channel commercial teams
Own Salesforce & Commercial Systems:
Serve as executive business owner of Salesforce and establish it as the enterprise system of record for commercial execution, forecasting, and operational visibility
Complete the Salesforce transformation now in flight, shifting the platform from a data repository into a source of insight and accountability
Own the commercial systems roadmap, sequencing new capability and integration of commercial technology behind the reporting and forecasting foundation
Manage and hold accountable external implementation and consulting partners to achieve the above
Define Metrics, Data Standards & Governance:
Define and govern commercial metric definitions, data standards, forecast categories, and sales stage criteria
Drive data quality and adoption across Sales, Finance, Product, Customer Success, and Marketing
Reduce manual reporting and spreadsheet reconciliation by moving the source of truth into governed systems
Partner & Build:
Partner with the CFO and FP&A on forecast alignment and revenue-driver analysis, with the CBO on field execution, and with the Chief Transformation & AI Officer on AI applied to commercial workflows
Own the revenue operations narrative for executive and Board audiences, with consistent definitions quarter over quarter
Build the roadmap for scaling the function as the commercial organization grows
